7. **Mechanistic Synthesis and Model Classification**
   - Integrate the results from the conditional $R_v(\tau)$ analysis and the shuffled surrogate test.
   - Classify the transport mechanism: (a) CTRW (if trapping times dominate), (b) fBm (if strain-field correlations dominate), or (c) a dual-mechanism (if both contribute to distinct components of the displacement PDF).
